<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Daily Viral Deals"
  description="How Daily Viral Deals handles information when you visit this site."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: November 11, 2026</em></p>

  <p>
    Daily Viral Deals (“we,” “us,” or “this site”) is an independent Amazon product review website at
    <a href="https://mybusinesswork.com">mybusinesswork.com</a>. This Privacy Policy explains what information we
    collect, how we use it, and your choices.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This site publishes product reviews and may include Amazon Associate affiliate links. We do not require you to
    create an account to read reviews.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you provide</h3>
  <p>
    If you contact us by email or another channel you choose, we collect whatever you send (such as your email address
    and message) so we can respond.
  </p>

  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting provider or content delivery network may automatically receive standard technical
    data when you visit, such as IP address, browser type, device type, pages viewed, referring URL, and approximate
    time of access. We use this information to operate, secure, and improve the site.
  </p>

  <h3>Cookies and similar technologies</h3>
  <p>
    This site itself does not set advertising cookies for third-party ad networks. Our host or security tools may use
    cookies or similar technologies that are necessary to deliver the site. Third-party sites you leave to—especially
    Amazon—have their own cookies and privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Amazon affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links go to Amazon.com and may include our Associate tracking tag. If you click those links, Amazon may collect
    information as described in
    <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GX7NJQ4ZB8MHFRNJ" rel="noopener" target="_blank"
      >Amazon’s Privacy Notice</a
    >. Purchases and commissions are handled by Amazon, not by us storing your payment details.
  </p>
  <p>See also our <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To operate and maintain this website</li>
    <li>To respond to messages you send us</li>
    <li>To understand basic traffic and fix technical issues</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations when required</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Sharing of information</h2>
  <p>We may share information only with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Service providers that host or help run this site (under their own terms)</li>
    <li>Amazon, when you choose to follow an affiliate link</li>
    <li>Authorities if required by law or to protect rights and safety</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    Technical logs are retained only as long as needed for security and operations, subject to our host’s practices.
    Contact messages are kept as long as needed to handle your request.
  </p>

  <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children
    under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict use of personal information
    we hold about you. To make a request, contact us using the details below. You can also control cookies through your
    browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party websites</h2>
  <p>
    Reviews may link to Amazon and other external sites. Their privacy practices are their own. This policy applies only
    to Daily Viral Deals.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will change when we do. Continued
    use of the site after an update means you acknowledge the revised policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this Privacy Policy: contact us via the Daily Viral Deals site operator for
    <strong>mybusinesswork.com</strong> (MyBusinessWorks).
  </p>
</Base>
